msgctxt "128"
msgid "Taichi! Mitsuo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Not now, Uncle Kaz! I was just about to go in for the\r\n"
"body slam!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Give the games a rest and listen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "...All right. What's up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "It's about Shiro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Wait, he wasn't in our room?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"He was, but he won't talk to me. He's just sitting curled\r\n"
"up in the corner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Yeah... He's been doing that a lot lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "What? Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Probably 'cause he's been getting bullied."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Bullied? How do you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"I found him crying in the boy's room at school a couple\r\n"
"weeks ago, so I asked him what was wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "And that's when he told you about the bullying?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Hm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "I think it's been getting worse, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "What makes you say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Well I thought it'd be funny to barge in on him when he was\r\n"
"taking a bath... but he had bruises all over his body."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"And he doesn't do sports or nothing so he wouldn't have\r\n"
"gotten 'em from that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Did you tell a teacher?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"Nuh-uh. The bullying always gets worse if you tattle.\r\n"
"Besides..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "I've heard enough. I'll talk to the teacher myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Wait, Uncle Kaz! I dunno if that's such a good idea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Taichi! Mitsuo! Where'd you say Shiro was, again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Pretty sure he's in our room!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Hoohah! Taichi Megafist!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Ow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Mitsuooo Chop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "(...Guess I'll take a look inside.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Hey, is Shiro with you two?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Hiyah! Taichi Bomb!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Ow! Don't hit so hard, Taichi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Hehehe. There's more where that came from!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Taichi Explosion!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "I asked you a question, Taichi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "C'mon, Uncle Kaz! Can't you see we're busy here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"Just take a break for one second. Do either of you know\r\n"
"where Shiro is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"Uhhhh, maybe in our room? We asked if he wanted to play\r\n"
"with us but he said no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "Tai...chi... Blast!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "Hey, no fair! I wasn't ready!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "I'm glad you kids are full of energy. Just..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Try not to get hurt, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "We'll be careful!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "You're never careful!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "(Guess I'll take a look inside.)"
msgstr ""

